      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING SIMELA (1) settled well back early on debut and always towards the tail to finish sixth (21.94) at Nowra over 365m. Drops down the inside box this time. Can get off the mark this time. BLUE BLARNEY (2) still a maiden but rarely out of the finish recording eight placings from nine starts. Hasn't been able to break through recently but continues to race well, filling the minors at the last three starts. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Bold showing expected. EGOMANIAC (4) is making her debut here for the Glen Quirk stable and profiles nicely. Can kick off with a good run. LA PRIMERA (5) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
